                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PIONEERS OF CLINICAL COMPUTING</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Decades before HITECH existed</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"170\" width=\"500\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">LOCKHEED / EL CAMINO</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Late 1960s, Mountain View CA</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">First-gen hospital info system</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Became Technicon Data Systems</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"170\" width=\"480\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">COSTAR (1968)</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">MGH, Octo Barnett</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">First ambulatory record system</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Lab of Computer Science</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"380\" width=\"500\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">REGENSTRIEF (1972)</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Indianapolis, Clem McDonald</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Computerized reminders</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Later: LOINC standard</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"380\" width=\"480\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PROMIS (1970s)</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Lawrence Weed, Vermont</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Problem-oriented record</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Origin of the problem list</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"590\" width=\"500\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">VistA (1985)</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">VA Department, MUMPS-based</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"715\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">First national-scale EHR</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Being replaced by Oracle Health</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"590\" width=\"480\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">EPIC + CERNER (1979)</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Founded the same year</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"715\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Faulkner / 3 KC accountants</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Future market dominators</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"810\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE FIELD WAITED 30 YEARS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">for federal money to push it into the mainstream</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The lineage of clinical computing before HITECH"
