                  "explanation": "NPSG 03.06.01 specifically addresses medication reconciliation — comparing medications a patient is taking to those that have been ordered, reconciling discrepancies, and communicating the reconciled list at each transition (admission, transfer, discharge). The EHR medication list module supports this directly. NPSG 01.01.01 covers two patient identifiers; 07.01.01 covers hand hygiene; 15.01.01 covers suicide risk reduction.",
