                  "explanation": "The Arch Collaborative is KLAS's clinician-experience benchmarking program. Member hospitals administer a standardized survey to their clinicians, and KLAS aggregates results so each hospital can compare its Net EHR Experience Score (NEES) to peers nationally. Best in KLAS is the annual vendor awards. Decision Insights tracks vendor switching by hospital. First Look Reports cover new emerging modules and AI tools.",
